1 REM FBCS FIL-0203
2 REM CLAIM A-11.2.4.2-09
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 11.2.4.2 l.7284-7286: data-found is false if the pointer is at end of
5 REM file (case 2) or at an empty record-area (case 3); the io-recovery of
6 REM SET # with POINTER RECORD / POINTER END acts accordingly.
10 OPEN #1: NAME "FIL0203.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION RELATIVE, RECTYPE INTERNAL
20 WRITE #1, RECORD 2: 9
30 SET #1: RECORD 5, IF MISSING THEN 100
40 PRINT "NO1"
50 STOP
100 PRINT "MISSING-AREA5"
110 SET #1: RECORD 2, IF MISSING THEN 200
120 PRINT "OK-REC2"
130 GOTO 210
200 PRINT "MISSING-REC2"
205 STOP
210 SET #1: POINTER END, IF MISSING THEN 300
220 PRINT "NO3"
230 STOP
300 PRINT "MISSING-END"
310 CLOSE #1
320 END
